<body>
<%- include("./layouts/navbar.ejs") %>

<main class="main-content">
    <header class="hero">
        <!-- <img src="/images/hero-image.jpg" alt="Hero Image" class="hero-image"> -->
        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>Welcome to Contact Manager</h1>
            <p>Manage your contacts effortlessly. Ensure no duplication within the same district and download PDFs of your contact lists.</p>
        </div>
    </header>
    <section class="features">
        <div class="feature">
            <h2>Smart Duplicate Check</h2>
            <p>Our system checks for duplicate contacts within the same district. If a contact already exists, it won't be saved again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h2>Flexible Contact Saving</h2>
            <p>Save contacts with the same number in different districts of the same province. We ensure no duplicates within a district.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h2>PDF Download</h2>
            <p>Easily download PDFs of your contacts. Get a comprehensive list of all contacts in a district with no duplications.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

